1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,750
Any entertainment there?

2
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:08,560
All right. Here we go! 1999,the year of Joey.
來羅！1999年 喬伊「快樂」的一年

3
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:10,330
We're very happy for you.
恭喜你 

4
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,700
What's the matter?
怎麼了？

5
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:15,540
We wanted to kiss at midnight, but nobody else will,so....
我們想在午夜接吻 但其他人都沒這個打算

6
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:18,410
All right,I'll take care of it.
好，交給我

7
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:21,180
It's 30 seconds to midnight, what are you gonna do?
喬伊，只剩30秒了 你能怎麼辦？

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,980
Will you just trust me?
相信我好嗎？

9
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,520
Thirty-three, 32, 31
33！32！31 

10
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:28,550
Who are you kissing at midnight? Rachel or Phoebe?
你0點要親誰？ 瑞秋還是菲比？

11
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,080
You can't kiss your sister.
你又不能親你妹

12
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,520
-Who's gonna kiss my sister? -Chandler.
那誰要親我妹？ 錢德

13
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:34,720
Oh,man! Really?
不會吧

14
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,900
Would you rather have me or him kiss her?
老兄，你覺得誰比較好 我還是錢德？

15
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,390
That's a good point.
有道理

16
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:42,090
Since I have that whole history with Rachel,I guess Phoebe.
我和瑞秋有太多糾葛 那就菲比吧

17
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,900
Phoebe! Listen. Ross wants to kiss you at midnight.
菲比！羅斯午夜想親你

19
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:49,910
So obvious. Why doesn't he just ask?
太明顯了，他大可直說

20
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:53,070
-Rach! I'm gonna kiss you at midnight. -What?
瑞秋！我午夜要親你 什麼？

21
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,610
You can't kiss Ross. You got the history.
你親羅斯會小尷尬

22
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:56,980
So?
所以呢？ 

23
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,780
-Would you prefer me or Chandler? -Good point.
所以你想讓我親還是讓錢德親 有道理 對吧

25
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:03,550
Three, two, one!
3！2！1！

26
00:01:03,790 --> 00:01:05,120
Happy New Year!
新年快樂！

27
00:01:11,630 --> 00:01:13,660
-Happy New Year. -Happy New Year.
新年快樂

28
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,460
-Happy New Year. -You too.
菲比，新年快樂 你也是

29
00:01:15,670 --> 00:01:16,900
Happy New Year,Joey.
喬伊，新年快樂

30
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:19,270
So that do anything for you?
剛才那個吻如何？

31
00:01:21,548 --> 00:01:23,880
The One with All the Resolutions
本集播出：「新年新希望」

00:01:25,548 --> 00:01:26,880
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

33
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,480
You know what?
你們知道嗎？

34
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:13,850
I'm gonna go out on a limb and say "No divorces in '99!"
我要召告天下 99年我不離婚

35
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:18,360
But your divorce isn't final yet.
但你的離婚手續還沒辦好

36
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:21,130
Just the one divorce in '99!
99年我只離一次婚 漂亮

37
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:27,530
I am gonna be happy this year. I am gonna make myself happy.
我今年要過得很快樂 我要讓自己快樂

38
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:29,870
Do you want us to leave the room?
你要我們迴避嗎？

39
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:35,010
Every day I am gonna do one thing I have never done before.
我每天都要做一件沒做過的事

40
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,380
That is my New Year's resolution.
這就是我的新年新希望

41
00:02:38,490 --> 00:02:39,780
That's a good one!
好棒的希望 

42
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:42,850
Mine is to pilot a commercial jet.
我是想開大型客機

43
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:46,690
Now you only have to find a planeload of people...
這個也很棒，接著你得找一群

44
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:50,060
...whose resolution is to plummet to their deaths.
希望自己墜機身亡的人

45
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:54,370
Maybe your resolution should be not to make fun of your friends.
也許你應該立志不取笑朋友

46
00:02:54,570 --> 00:02:58,340
Especially the ones who might fly you to Europe for free.
尤其是會免費載你去歐洲的人

47
00:02:58,710 --> 00:03:01,640
She has a better chance of flying up your nose...
她開飛機的機率 

48
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:04,310
...than you do of not making fun of us.
比你不取笑我們還高

49
00:03:05,010 --> 00:03:08,920
I'll bet $50 you can't go the year without making fun of us.
50元賭你無法1年不笑我們

50
00:03:09,150 --> 00:03:10,550
Better yet,a week.
乾脆1星期好了 

51
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:12,480
I'll take that bet,my friend.
我賭了

52
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,750
Paying me the $50 can be...
輸我那50元 就可以當你的...

53
00:03:14,990 --> 00:03:17,510
...the "new thing you do" that day.
「每日新鮮事」

54
00:03:19,730 --> 00:03:22,220
And it starts right now!
就從現在開始

55
00:03:22,830 --> 00:03:26,600
My New Year's resolution is to learn how to play guitar.
我的新年新希望是學吉他

56
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,230
Really? How come?
真的？為什麼？

57
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:32,030
You know those special skills I have listed on my resume?
我的履歷表 不是列了一堆特殊專長

58
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,940
I would love it if one of those was true.
我希望有一項是真的

59
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:38,070
Want me to teach you? I'm a great teacher.
你要我教你嗎？ 我是個很好的老師

60
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,910
Really? Who have you taught?
真的？你教過誰？

61
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:42,670
Well, I taught me. And I loved me.
我教過我，我很喜歡我

62
00:03:43,450 --> 00:03:45,850
That'd be great! Yeah, thanks, Phoebe.
太好了，謝謝你

63
00:03:46,290 --> 00:03:49,720
My resolution is to be less obsessed with being neat and clean.
我希望自己不要那麼潔癖

64
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:51,220
Really?
是嗎？

65
00:03:52,098 --> 00:03:53,531
No!
不要

66
00:03:58,270 --> 00:04:00,260
Or something else.
換一個好了

67
00:04:01,940 --> 00:04:04,030
Look. Blaire forgot her glasses.
布萊兒忘了把眼鏡帶走 

68
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:07,070
She'll need these to keep an eye on that boyfriend.
她需要這副眼鏡來盯住男朋友

69
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:10,730
Who,from what I hear, needs to keep his stapler...
聽說他得把訂書機...

70
00:04:10,950 --> 00:04:14,140
...in his desk drawer, if you know what I mean!
...收在收屜裡 你們懂我的意思吧

71
00:04:15,050 --> 00:04:18,110
Maybe your resolution should be to gossip less.
或許你應該讓自己別那麼八卦

72
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,250
What? I don't gossip.
我哪有八卦

73
00:04:23,090 --> 00:04:25,220
Maybe sometimes I find out things.
或許我偶爾會發現一些事 

74
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:28,950
Or I hear something and I pass that information on.
或聽到一些事，然後轉述出去

75
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,930
You know, kind of like a public service.
當做一種服務

76
00:04:32,170 --> 00:04:35,470
It doesn't mean I'm a gossip. Is Ted Koppel a gossip?
這並不代表我很八卦 你們會說新聞主播八卦嗎？

77
00:04:35,670 --> 00:04:40,070
If Ted Koppel talked about his coworkers' botched boob jobs, I would.
如果他說同事隆胸失敗的話

78
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:43,070
They were like this!
她隆成這樣耶

79
00:04:45,110 --> 00:04:49,570
Fine, my New Year's resolution will be not to gossip.
好，我的新年新希望 就是不八卦

80
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:52,910
-It's easy. -Easy? You have never kept a resolution.
這還不簡單 簡單？你從來沒做到過

81
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:56,120
-Yes, I have. -Okay, let's see how you did last year.
我當然有 好，來看看你去年的表現

82
00:04:56,260 --> 00:04:59,350
No. No. Not my diary. You cannot read my diary.
不要拿我的日記 你不能看我的日記

83
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:02,460
"Dear diary: I'm so excited.
親愛的日記：我好興奮 

84
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:07,260
My resolution is to write in you every day. See you tomorrow."
我的新年新希望是每天寫你 我們明天見

86
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,630
Nothing.
什麼都沒寫

87
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:14,570
You know,not a lot happened last year.
去年發生了很多事

88
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:19,370
All right,I will prove to you that I can keep it this time. No more gossiping.
好，我這次會證明給你們看 我再也不八卦了

89
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:23,580
I hate gossip. In junior high this girl said a lot of mean stuff about me...
講到八卦，國中時 有個女生說了我很多壞話

91
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,520
...and I set her bike on fire.
我就放火燒她的腳踏車

92
00:05:25,650 --> 00:05:29,090
-Wow,what did she say about you? -She said I was crazy.
她說你什麼？ 她說我是瘋子

93
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:32,120
But I guess she got hers.
得到報應了吧

94
00:05:34,067 --> 00:05:35,831
「中央咖啡館」

95
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:40,360
-I'll see you tomorrow. -Okay.
那就明天見 好

96
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:44,330
I just asked that girl out.
我約剛才那個女生出去 

97
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:46,200
Nice!
漂亮

98
00:05:46,470 --> 00:05:49,030
Is that part of your "new thing" for today?
這算是你今天的新鮮事嗎？

99
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,180
Yes, it is. See?
沒錯，你們看

100
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,670
"Elizabeth...
伊麗莎白…

101
00:05:53,650 --> 00:05:55,210
...Hornswoggle"?
宏史歪哥？

102
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:58,080
That's right.
對…

103
00:05:58,690 --> 00:06:01,660
Elizabeth Hornswoggle.
伊麗莎白宏史歪哥

104
00:06:03,329 --> 00:06:06,025
Horn..swoggle
宏史歪哥

105
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,920
You okay,Chandler?
你還好嗎？ 

106
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:11,690
Something funny about that name?
這個姓有哪裡好笑嗎？

107
00:06:12,270 --> 00:06:15,430
No, I just think I've heard it somewhere before.
沒有，我只是覺得好像聽過

108
00:06:18,410 --> 00:06:21,070
Oh, really? Where?
是嗎？在哪裡聽過？ 

109
00:06:21,910 --> 00:06:24,380
Somewhere funny,I'll bet.
一定是個很好笑的地方

110
00:06:26,110 --> 00:06:27,310
Guess what.
你猜怎麼著

111
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:31,110
I have a date with Elizabeth Hornswoggle.
我要跟一個伊麗莎白… 宏史歪哥約會

112
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,750
Hornswoggle. Oh, this must be killing you!
宏史歪哥？ 你的嘴一定很癢

114
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,220
Not really.
才不會

115
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:45,820
-I haven't told you her middle name yet. -Well,don't. Just don't.
我還沒說她中間的名字 拜託 不要

116
00:06:45,970 --> 00:06:47,700
-See you later. -See you.
待會見

117
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:51,070
All right, Phoebe, I am ready for my first lesson. 
菲比，我可以上第一課了 

118
00:06:52,170 --> 00:06:53,940
No, you don't touch the guitar.
不行，不能碰吉他

119
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:56,940
First you learn here, then here.
先練手，再練琴

120
00:06:58,317 --> 00:06:59,284
Okay.
好吧

121
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:03,750
Lesson one: Chords.
好，第一課，和弦

122
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:07,750
Now,I don't know the actual names of the chords.
我不知道這些和弦的真正名稱

123
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:13,160
But I made up names for the way my hand looks while I'm doing them.
不過我照手勢幫它們取了名字

124
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,630
So then this is "Bear Claw."
所以這是熊爪…

125
00:07:19,670 --> 00:07:21,190
"Turkey Leg"...
火雞腳…

126
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:24,770
...and "Old Lady."
和老太太

127
00:07:26,710 --> 00:07:29,970
What an interesting approach to guitar instruction.
真有趣的吉他教學方式

128
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:36,170
You know,some might find it amusing. I myself find it regular.
有些人可能會覺得好笑 我覺得很普通

129
00:07:39,690 --> 00:07:40,680
Hey, everybody!
各位

130
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:43,690
Rachel was so good today. She didn't gossip at all.
瑞秋今天很乖 她都沒有八卦

131
00:07:43,890 --> 00:07:46,450
I didn't. Even when I found out
沒錯，即使我發現…

132
00:07:46,690 --> 00:07:49,720
Let's say I found out something about someone...
總之我發現了某人的某件事 

133
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,400
...and let's just say...
但是...

134
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:53,290
...she's gonna keep it.
...我不會說出來

135
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:57,700
Check this out.
菲比，你看

136
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:04,740
You nailed the Old Lady!
你搞定老太太了

137
00:08:10,050 --> 00:08:15,150
I thought I was getting better, so I stopped by this guitar store
我覺得我進步了 就在回家的路上去吉他店…

138
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:18,360
Did you touch any of the guitars there?
你在店裡有碰吉他嗎？

139
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,420
Did you?
有嗎？

140
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,150
No.
沒有

141
00:08:25,930 --> 00:08:27,920
Give me your hands.
手給我

142
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,840
Strings. This
琴弦，這一隻

143
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,500
Pick.
彈片

144
00:08:34,710 --> 00:08:38,410
-Do you want to learn to play guitar? -Yes.
你想學吉他嗎？ 想啊

145
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:39,840
Then don't touch one!
那就不要碰吉他

146
00:08:44,290 --> 00:08:46,720
-Hi,Ben. -Auntie Monica!
班 摩妮卡姑姑

147
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:50,190
Ross is wearing leather pants!
羅斯穿皮褲

148
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:57,930
Does nobody else see Ross is wearing leather pants?
沒有人看見羅斯穿皮褲嗎？

149
00:08:58,630 --> 00:09:01,300
Someone comment on the pants!
誰來說句話吧

150
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:06,270
-I think they're very nice. -I really like them a lot.
很帥氣啊 我很喜歡

151
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,870
Not what I had in mind.
我想的不是這個

152
00:09:10,110 --> 00:09:13,740
People like Ross don't wear these types of pants.
羅斯這種人通常不穿這種褲子

153
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:16,280
You see, they're very tight.
這種褲子很緊

154
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:19,410
Maybe there's something in that area?
也許可以評論一下

155
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:22,550
I think they look really good.
很好看啊

156
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:25,420
Where'd you get them?
在哪裡買的？

157
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:27,750
I needed a new thing for today.
我還沒做今天的新鮮事

158
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:31,490
There's this leather store that always smells so good.
我一直覺得這家皮衣店很香

159
00:09:31,730 --> 00:09:35,100
And I thought to myself:  "Wow. I've never owned...
於是我心想 我從來沒買過...

160
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:39,640
...a really good-smelling pair of pants before."
...一條很香的皮褲

161
00:09:42,410 --> 00:09:44,280
Oh,come on!
拜託啦！

162
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:49,770
What do you think?
說真的，你們覺得怎樣？

163
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:51,140
You look like a freak.
好怪 

164
00:09:51,350 --> 00:09:52,340
Awful!
難看死了

165
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,650
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

166
00:09:57,860 --> 00:10:01,320
-It's my New Year's resolution. -To blind my child?
這是我的新年新希望 把我兒子弄瞎？

167
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:04,120
To take pictures of us together.
不，是多照照我們的相片

168
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:07,060
It's the best resolution. Everyone can enjoy them.
我覺得這樣最好 大家都會喜歡

169
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:09,670
Everyone will enjoy my music as well.
大家也都會喜歡我的演奏

170
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:25,780
My God,these pants! I'm burning up.
天哪，這條褲子熱死了

171
00:10:27,690 --> 00:10:32,180
Oh God! She wants to snuggle now? Is she trying to kill me?
她現在靠過來是想讓我死嗎？ 

172
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:34,520
It's like a volcano in here!
這裡面跟火山一樣

173
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:39,330
-Are you hot? -No.
你熱嗎？ 不會

174
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:41,990
It must just be me, then.
那就是我在熱

175
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:58,080
That was just the pants and the couch.
那是褲子跟沙發磨擦的聲音

176
00:11:00,860 --> 00:11:02,980
Do you mind if I use your bathroom?
可以借用一下洗手間嗎？

177
00:11:03,220 --> 00:11:05,390
-Go ahead. -Thanks.
請便 謝謝

178
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:48,130
My favorite part's coming up!
我最喜歡的部分要來了 好

179
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,710
Oh,my God!
完蛋了

180
00:12:11,490 --> 00:12:12,480
Tiger.
老虎

181
00:12:12,630 --> 00:12:13,650
Dragon.
恐龍

182
